##
## Upstream tests to disable on macOS
##
## When adding a new filter to this list, please include a short description of
## why the filter is required and create an associated tracking issue.
##

# These expect setup to write and load the wake plist. We never register the
# wake job so Omaha 4 doesn't run at the same time as Sparkle, see
# chromium_src/chrome/updater/mac/setup/mac_setup.mm.
-IntegrationTest.InstallWithInheritedQuarantine
-IntegrationTest.OverinstallBrokenKeepsWakePlist
-IntegrationTest.OverinstallBrokenRepairsQuarantinedWakePlist
